View of the steep face, which you will be climbing on the left-hand side of the picture.

<HikeImage idx={17} />

Due to heavy rain and the difficulty of the route, there are no pictures here.

## Arrival at the mountain station

Once we reached the top of the station, the weather improved again, offering a lovely view.
A good spot to enjoy a proper dessert.

<HikeImage idx={18} />
<HikeImage idx={19} />
<HikeImage idx={20} />

## Journey home

A rack railway runs from the mountain station to Capolago-Riva S.Vitale. From there, you can quickly reach Lugano or other destinations by train.
<JourneyPlanner from="Generoso Vetta" to="<current location>" fromFixed target=departure time="14:30" />
